{"content_hash": "00951000d39e0579", "version_id": 642, "article_id": 65, "level_code": "en_a2", "lang": "en", "level": 2, "level_label": "A2 初级", "title": "Michael Jordan's 1998 jersey sells for record £10.6m", "title_zh": "乔丹1998年球衣拍出创纪录的1060万英镑", "has_translation": true, "topic": "sports", "source": "bbc_sport", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/sport/basketball/articles/cje36qz977yqo?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1641919868936-bc8702cb887e?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8NXx8am9yZGFuJTIwbGFzdCUyMGRhbmNlfGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTE4NTkxNTN8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Keith Christian Armada on Unsplash", "author": "Keith Christian Armada", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@armada_kc?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-pair-of-red-and-black-sneakers-with-flames-in-the-background-v2hJG3bD-sY?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(176, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(214, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SPORTS", "seed": "15c81305d86b"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-13", "word_count": 132, "reading_minutes": 0.7, "lead": "A Michael Jordan jersey from his last season with the Chicago Bulls has sold for $14m (£10.6m). It is a record for basketball memorabilia.", "lead_zh": "迈克尔·乔丹在芝加哥公牛队最后一个赛季穿过的一件球衣以1400万美元（1060万英镑）售出。这创下了篮球纪念品的拍卖纪录。", "preview": "Jordan wore the jersey in game two of the 1998 NBA Finals. He signed it too. He scored 37 points that night and the Bulls won the series 4-2", "preview_zh": "乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛第二场穿过这件球衣，还在上面签了名。那晚他得了37分，公牛队以4比2赢得系列赛。这是他的第六个、也是最后一个NBA总冠军。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 630, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/65/en_a2.wav", "duration": 54.85, "size_bytes": 2637644, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 168, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@870ce8b/content/data/versions/642.json", "paragraphs": ["Jordan wore the jersey in game two of the 1998 NBA Finals. He signed it too. He scored 37 points that night and the Bulls won the series 4-2. It was his sixth and final NBA championship.", "The buyer is Ron Firman, a real estate investor from Miami. He bought it in a private sale through Hunt Auctions. The auction house said Jordan items are now like fine art.", "Only one sports item has sold for more. It is the baseball jersey worn by Babe Ruth in 1932. It sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.", "Two weeks ago, another Jordan jersey from the 1998 Finals sold for $12.3m (£9.3m). That one was not signed. The old basketball record was a Jordan and Kobe Bryant card. It sold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year."], "paragraphs_zh": ["乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛第二场穿过这件球衣，还在上面签了名。那晚他得了37分，公牛队以4比2赢得系列赛。这是他的第六个、也是最后一个NBA总冠军。", "买家是罗恩·菲尔曼，迈阿密的一位房地产投资人。他通过亨特拍卖行私下买下这件球衣。拍卖行说，乔丹的物品现在就像艺术品一样。", "只有一件体育纪念品卖得更贵，那就是贝比·鲁斯1932年穿过的棒球球衣，2024年以2410万美元（1820万英镑）售出。", "两周前，另一件1998年总决赛的乔丹球衣以1230万美元（930万英镑）售出，那件没有签名。此前的篮球纪录是一张乔丹和科比·布莱恩特的球星卡，去年以1290万美元（980万英镑）成交。"], "body": "Jordan wore the jersey in game two of the 1998 NBA Finals. He signed it too. He scored 37 points that night and the Bulls won the series 4-2. It was his sixth and final NBA championship.\n\nThe buyer is Ron Firman, a real estate investor from Miami. He bought it in a private sale through Hunt Auctions. The auction house said Jordan items are now like fine art.\n\nOnly one sports item has sold for more. It is the baseball jersey worn by Babe Ruth in 1932. It sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.\n\nTwo weeks ago, another Jordan jersey from the 1998 Finals sold for $12.3m (£9.3m). That one was not signed. The old basketball record was a Jordan and Kobe Bryant card. It sold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.", "body_zh": "乔丹在1998年NBA总决赛第二场穿过这件球衣，还在上面签了名。那晚他得了37分，公牛队以4比2赢得系列赛。这是他的第六个、也是最后一个NBA总冠军。\n\n买家是罗恩·菲尔曼，迈阿密的一位房地产投资人。他通过亨特拍卖行私下买下这件球衣。拍卖行说，乔丹的物品现在就像艺术品一样。\n\n只有一件体育纪念品卖得更贵，那就是贝比·鲁斯1932年穿过的棒球球衣，2024年以2410万美元（1820万英镑）售出。\n\n两周前，另一件1998年总决赛的乔丹球衣以1230万美元（930万英镑）售出，那件没有签名。此前的篮球纪录是一张乔丹和科比·布莱恩特的球星卡，去年以1290万美元（980万英镑）成交。", "text": "Jordan wore the jersey in game two of the 1998 NBA Finals. He signed it too. He scored 37 points that night and the Bulls won the series 4-2. It was his sixth and final NBA championship. The buyer is Ron Firman, a real estate investor from Miami. He bought it in a private sale through Hunt Auctions. The auction house said Jordan items are now like fine art. Only one sports item has sold for more. It is the baseball jersey worn by Babe Ruth in 1932. It sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024. Two weeks ago, another Jordan jersey from the 1998 Finals sold for $12.3m (£9.3m). That one was not signed. The old basketball record was a Jordan and Kobe Bryant card. It sold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.", "vocab": [{"word": "jersey", "pos": "noun", "zh": "球衣", "note": "运动队服，常用于篮球、足球等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sell", "pos": "verb", "zh": "卖，出售", "note": "过去式 sold，过去分词 sold", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "record", "pos": "noun", "zh": "纪录", "note": "这里指最高纪录", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sign", "pos": "verb", "zh": "签名", "note": "在物品上签名", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "score", "pos": "verb", "zh": "得分", "note": "比赛中的得分", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "championship", "pos": "noun", "zh": "冠军", "note": "指冠军头衔或比赛", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "buyer", "pos": "noun", "zh": "买家", "note": "买东西的人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "auction", "pos": "noun", "zh": "拍卖", "note": "公开出售给出价最高者", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "title_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m", "summary_original": "A Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season sells for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.", "body_original": "Jordan 'Last Dance' jersey sells for record £10.6m\nBy\nBen Collins\nBBC Sport journalist\nPublished\n5 hours ago\nA Michael Jordan jersey from his 'Last Dance' season has sold for $14m (£10.6m), a record for a piece of basketball memorabilia.\nJordan wore the Chicago Bulls jersey during game two of the 1998 NBA Finals and has autographed it too.\nHe scored a game-high 37 points that evening before ending his last season with the Bulls with a 4-2 series win for his sixth and final NBA Championship. He was named the Finals' Most Valuable Player in all six.\nThe only item of sports memorabilia that has cost more is the jersey worn by baseball legend Babe Ruth when he \"called the shot\" during the 1932 World Series, which was sold for $24.1m (£18.2m) in 2024.\nThe previous high for a basketball item was a card featuring Jordan and Kobe Bryant from 2007-08 which\nsold for $12.9m (£9.8m) last year.\nThe previous record for a piece of game-worn Jordan memorabilia was set just two weeks ago when his jersey from game three of the 1998 Finals, which is not autographed,\nsold via auction for $12.3m (£9.3m).\nThe latest purchase was made by Miami real estate investor Ron Firman in a private sale through Hunt Auctions.\nDavid Hunt, president of Hunt Auctions, said in a statement: \"While Michael Jordan's importance within the sports memorabilia marketplace has long been established, it has now escalated to an elite asset class more typically reserved for iconic works of art.\"\nRelated topics\nBasketball\nMore on this story\nWhy everyone’s talking about The Last Dance\nPublished\n12 May 2020\nMaradona's 'Hand of God' shirt sells for £7.1m\nPublished\n4 May 2022", "fetched_at": "2026-10-13T02:39:12.219452", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Jordan", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.675, "sm": 300, "em": 675, "cs": 0, "ce": 6, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "wore", "s": 0.675, "e": 0.887, "sm": 675, "em": 887, "cs": 7, "ce": 11, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "the", "s": 0.887, "e": 0.987, "sm": 887, "em": 987, "cs": 12, "ce": 15, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "jersey", "s": 0.988, "e": 1.45, "sm": 987, "em": 1449, 